# ==============================================================================
# ProspectPilot Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# You do NOT need a paid API key to test or demonstrate this system.
# You can run 100% offline using the `--mock` flag or `pytest`.

# If you want to run live tool-calling with a real model, choose ANY ONE of these:

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option A: OpenAI (gpt-4o-mini is very cheap: ~1/5 of a cent per run)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# PROSPECTPILOT_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option B: Groq (FREE tier with ultra-fast inference & reliable tool-calling)
# Sign up at: https://console.groq.com/keys
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
# PROSPECTPILOT_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option C: Google Gemini (FREE tier with OpenAI-compatible endpoint)
# Sign up at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# PROSPECTPILOT_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option D: OpenRouter (Flexible multi-model aggregator with micro-pricing)
# Sign up at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# PROSPECTPILOT_MODEL=deepseek/deepseek-chat

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option E: Local Ollama (100% free, runs offline on your machine)
# Install from https://ollama.ai and run: ollama run llama3.1
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# OPENAI_API_KEY=ollama
# PROSPECTPILOT_MODEL=llama3.1
